  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"As\u0131lan Adam\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nKart
    d\xFCz a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131nda \"ba\u015F a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131\" as\u0131lan
    bu adam s\xFCre\xE7lerdeki t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131, bocalamay\u0131
    ve duraksamay\u0131 i\u015Faret ederken, sendeki gibi ters a\xE7\u0131lmas\u0131
    sonu\xE7lara do\u011Fru son h\u0131zla var\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6steriyor
    {{isim}}. \xC7abalar\u0131n bo\u015Fa gitmemi\u015F. Emeklerin, t\xFCm belirsizlikleri
    ve ya\u015Fanmas\u0131 muhtemel t\xFCm ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131klar\u0131
    ortadan kald\u0131rm\u0131\u015F. Halinden memnun olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n i\u015Flerin
    bile azmin kar\u015F\u0131s\u0131nda d\xFCzelerek yoluna girmi\u015F. \"Neden
    hep ben?\" sorusunu sitemkar bir \u015Fekilde sormay\u0131 en sonunda nihayet
    b\u0131rakm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n."
